  "description": "The Voopoo VMATE PRO Power Edition Pod Kit builds on the original VMATE PRO kit, delivering significant upgrades to performance, flavour, and convenience. Powered by a 900mAh built-in battery, this sleek and ergonomic device can deliver up to 30W of power, making it suitable for MTL (mouth-to-lung) and RDL (restricted direct-to-lung) vaping styles. One of the standout features of the VMATE PRO Power Edition is the upgraded 2ml VMATE Top Fill Cartridge, designed to deliver richer flavour and longer-lasting performance. The kit includes pod with a pre-installed 0.4ohm mesh coil ideal for RDL vaping with 50/50 or high-VG e-liquids, and a 0.7ohm mesh coil pod suitable for MTL vaping with 50/50 and nic salts. The top-fill mechanism simplifies refilling, eliminating the need to remove the pod from the device, while the leak-proof design ensures a mess-free experience. The pod’s innovative design ensures up to 30 days of usage without leaking, providing both longevity and reliability. This device is compatible with the full VMATE Pod Family, giving you access to various pod and coil resistance options depending on your preferences. The VMATE PRO Power Edition also features stepless airflow adjustment, allowing you to fine-tune your draw for a more tailored vaping experience. With a USB Type-C charging port and 5V/2A fast charging, the VMATE PRO Power Edition can reach full charge in just 35 minutes, making it an ideal choice for vapers seeking a fast, hassle-free device. Browse our vape liquid and choose the ideal match for this kit. Pod Details: We recommend using the following E-Liquid with this kit: Voopoo VMate Top-Fill Pod 0.4ohm RDTL - Use High VG or 50/50 E-Liquid Voopoo VMate Top-Fill Pod 0.7ohm MTL - Use 50/50 or Nic Salts E-Liquid Please Note: To improve the performance and longevity of your new Pods, always prime them with your chosen e-liquid before inserting into your device 'Priming' simply means wetting the exposed cotton or similar wicking material with e-liquid before use. This helps prevent dry hits and burning the coil should it fail to soak up e-liquid properly before firing the vape device. Once you've primed your pod, attached it to your device, allow to stand for 5-10 minutes before vaping.",
